{#-
  ════════ RETIREMENT FAMILY STRIP ════════

  The four questions of the retirement decision funnel, in order, with the
  current page marked. Rendered on all four family pages and on the hub, plus
  the homepage — five surfaces from one file.

  WHY THE STYLES LIVE IN THE COMPONENT. Page CSS on this site is a per-page
  include, so styling this strip the usual way would mean editing four
  stylesheets to add one shared component. Carrying its own scoped `<style>`
  keeps the per-page edit to a single include line, which is what makes the
  strip safe to add to a further page later. Every selector is prefixed
  `rfam-`; every colour is a var with a literal fallback, because the host
  pages declare their palettes independently and a bare var() would fail
  silently on any page that named a token differently.

  Usage — one line:
      {% include 'components/retirement-family.njk' %}

  Optionally set the heading level first, so each surface's document outline
  stays sane (the strip is an H2 under a page H1 by default; a page that
  places it inside an existing section may want H3):
      {% set rfam_level = 'h3' %}
      {% include 'components/retirement-family.njk' %}

  THE COMPONENT OWNS ITS HEADING. It carries its own eyebrow + title, so host
  pages must NOT wrap it in one — that produced two stacked headings saying
  nearly the same thing on the compare page, which is why the wrapper was
  removed there (2026-08-26).

  TWO VARIANTS, BY SLUG:
    · on the hub itself the TITLE IS SUPPRESSED — it would restate the H1 a
      few hundred pixels above it. Eyebrow, framing sentence, row and foot
      all remain, so the strip still reads as the same object.
    · everywhere else the title is a LINK to the hub, and is the strip's
      primary route there. The current page is marked from the page's own
      `slug`; a slug outside the family (the homepage) marks nothing, which
      is correct — no card is "you are here".
-#}
{%- set rfamLevel = rfam_level | default('h2') -%}
{%- set onHub = (slug == 'bitcoin-retirement') -%}
<style>
/* One cohesive object containing four. The frame is deliberately LOWER
   contrast than the tool cards inside it — the cards are the things being
   chosen between, and a frame competing with them would read as a fifth. */
.rfam { max-width: 1100px; margin: 3.2rem auto 0; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.2rem; border: 1px solid rgba(224,148,34,0.09); border-radius: 10px; }
.rfam-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; margin: 0 0 0.55rem; }
.rfam-icon { flex: none; width: 40px; height: 30px; display: block; }
.rfam-icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
.rfam-headtext { min-width: 0; }
.rfam-tag { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber, #e09422); margin: 0 0 0.1rem; }
.rfam-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.6vw, 1.75rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--ink-bright, #f2eee8); margin: 0; }
.rfam-title a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.rfam-title a:hover { color: var(--amber, #e09422); }
.rfam-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--amber, #e09422); }
.rfam-lede { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-dim, #9a9080); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; max-width: 68ch; }
.rfam-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0.55rem; }
.rfam-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.22rem; padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid var(--border-faint, rgba(224,148,34,0.15)); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.035); text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s; }
a.rfam-item:hover { border-color: rgba(224,148,34,0.34); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.08); }
.rfam-item.is-here { border-color: var(--amber, #e09422); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.1); }
.rfam-step { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber, #e09422); }
.rfam-item.is-here .rfam-step::after { content: ' — you are here'; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dim, #9a9080); }
.rfam-q { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ink-bright, #f2eee8); }
.rfam-t { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-dim, #9a9080); }
.rfam-foot { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.76rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-dim, #9a9080); margin: 0.7rem 0 0; }
.rfam-foot a { color: var(--amber, #e09422); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(224,148,34,0.4); }
.rfam-foot a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--amber, #e09422); }
@media (max-width: 860px) { .rfam-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 560px) { .rfam { padding: 0.9rem 1rem 1rem; } }
@media (max-width: 460px) { .rfam-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
{%- set fam = [
  { slug: 'the-bitcoin-retirement',            step: 'Build',  q: 'What does my plan look like?',       t: 'One plan in full model context.' },
  { slug: 'bitcoin-escape-velocity',           step: 'Size',   q: 'How much is enough?',                t: 'The threshold your plan sits on.' },
  { slug: 'compare-retirement-plans',          step: 'Choose', q: 'Which of my options?',               t: 'Two complete plans, side by side.' },
  { slug: 'the-bitcoin-retirement-stress-test', step: 'Stress', q: 'Does it survive bad luck?',          t: 'The plan you picked, under a crash.' }
] -%}
<nav class="rfam" aria-label="The retirement decision funnel">
  <div class="rfam-head">
    {%- if not onHub %}
    <span class="rfam-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% include 'components/calc-tile-icons/bitcoin-retirement.njk' %}</span>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="rfam-headtext">
      <p class="rfam-tag">Four questions, in order</p>
      {%- if not onHub %}
      <{{ rfamLevel }} class="rfam-title"><a href="/bitcoin-retirement">Plan Your <em>Bitcoin</em> Retirement</a></{{ rfamLevel }}>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="rfam-lede">Retiring on a bitcoin stack is one decision asked four ways &mdash; each tool below answers one of them, and together they&rsquo;re the complete picture.</p>
  <div class="rfam-row">
    {%- for f in fam -%}
      {%- if f.slug == slug -%}
    <span class="rfam-item is-here" aria-current="page">
      <span class="rfam-step">{{ f.step }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-q">{{ f.q }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-t">{{ f.t }}</span>
    </span>
      {%- else -%}
    <a class="rfam-item" href="/{{ f.slug }}">
      <span class="rfam-step">{{ f.step }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-q">{{ f.q }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-t">{{ f.t }}</span>
    </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  <p class="rfam-foot">Your inputs travel between these tools &mdash; the links each page offers carry the plan you are looking at, so you rarely re-type a number.{% if not onHub %} <a href="/bitcoin-retirement">Start from the beginning &rarr;</a>{% endif %}</p>
</nav>
